// The texts put to Jev. Code reads this file; it does not contain them.
//
// This is `ANTS.md` §4.5: the wording is the work, and it must be changeable
// without a compiler. Edit the file and press "Reload from file" in the game,
// or edit the text in the game directly and watch the next answers change.
//
// What belongs here are only the *texts*. The option list itself is never
// written down anywhere — it is built from what the ant can see, every single
// request, which is what keeps Jev from naming a fruit that is not there.
Questions(
    // The one question of step 1. It is asked as a `choice`, against the option
    // list that ant was offered.
    step: "Which single step should this ant take now? Follow the ant queen's order whenever it applies.",
)
